messages:  ["Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 319247 and 735068? Please reason step by step.\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 319247 and 735068, we need to follow these steps:\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, making sure the digits in the same place value are in the same column.\n2. Add the digits starting from the rightmost column (units place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum in any column is 10 or more, carry over the tens digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\n</think>\n<answer>\nLet's perform the addition step by step:\n```\n  319247\n+ 735068\n---------\n```\nStarting from the rightmost column (units place):\n7 + 8 = 15. Write down 5 and carry over 1.\n```\n  319247\n+ 735068\n---------\n      5\n```\nNext column (tens place):\n4 + 6 + 1 (carried over) = 11. Write down 1 and carry over 1.\n```\n  319247\n+ 735068\n---------\n     15\n```\nNext column (hundreds place):\n2 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 3.\n```\n  319247\n+ 735068\n---------\n    315\n```\nNext column (thousands place):\n9 + 5 + 1 (carried over) = 15. Write down 5 and carry over 1.\n```\n  319247\n+ 735068\n---------\n   5315\n```\nNext column (ten thousands place):\n1 + 3 + 1 (carried over) = 5.\n```\n  319247\n+ 735068\n---------\n  55315\n```\nFinally, the leftmost column (hundred thousands place):\n3 + 7 = 10. Write down 0 and carry over 1.\n```\n  319247\n+ 735068\n---------\n1053155\n```\nSo, the sum of 319247 and 735068 is 1053155.\n</answer>\n"]
