      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, let's add the numbers column by column from right to left, starting with the units place:\n   - Units place: 3 + 4 = 7\n   - Tens place: 7 + 0 = 7\n   - Hundreds place: 8 + 6 = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1)\n   - Thousands place: 4 + 9 + 1 (carry over) = 14 (write down 4 and carry over 1)\n   - Ten thousands place: 4 + 0 + 1 (carry over) = 5\n   - Hundred thousands place: 3 + 6 = 9\n4. Putting it all together, we get:\n   ```\n   344873\n   +609604\n   ------\n   954477\n   ```\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe sum of 344873 and 609604 is 954477.\n</answer>",
